!LICENSE
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/daily_checkin.yml
!extension/
!extension/**

# 忽略常见的 Python 缓存和本地环境
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
config.json
*.log
